mit-Kr-Choudhary.jpg" alt="Dr. Amit Kr. Choudhary" class="max mb-2 rounded-3 lazy" width="230" height="256"> </a> <hr class="op1 mt-0"> <div class="text-center px-3"> <h4 class="font18 fw-600 mb-1"><a href="doctor/dr-amit-kr-choudhary" class="d-block th-color">Dr. Amit Kr. Choudhary</a></h4> <p class="lh-22 font14 m-0 fw-500 color333">MBBS, MS, M.Ch Plastic Surgery</p> </div> <div class="sanko"> <div class="full px-3 pb-2 d-flex align-items-center justify-content-center"> <a href="doctor/dr-amit-kr-choudhary" class="btn btn-sm btn3 lh-20 font14 outline">Know More <i class="bi bi-arrow-right-short"></i></a> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div class="item prelative bg-white"> <div class="docblock rounded-5 ofhidden border2 bg-whitee coolbg shadow-sm height100 prelative"> <a href="doctor/dr-manish-kumar-mishra" class="d-block p-3 pb-0 text-center rounded-3 bg-white"> <img src="images/placeholder_2.jpg" data-src="images/1729247656Dr manish, web.jpg" data-srcset="1729247656Dr.html NaNh, web.jpg" alt="Dr. Manish Kumar Mishra" class="max mb-2 rounded-3 lazy" width="230" height="256"> </a> <hr class="op1 mt-0"> <div class="text-center px-3"> <h4 class="font18 fw-600 mb-1"><a href="doctor/dr-manish-kumar-mishra" class="d-block th-color">Dr. Manish Kumar Mishra</a></h4> <p class="lh-22 font14 m-0 fw-500 color333">MD, DM (Gastro) Gold Medalist</p> </div> <div class="sanko"> <div class="full px-3 pb-2 d-flex align-items-center justify-content-center"> <a href="doctor/dr-manish-kumar-mishra" class="btn btn-sm btn3 lh-20 font14 outline">Know More <i class="bi bi-arrow-right-short"></i></a> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div class="item prelative bg-white"> <div class="docblock rounded-5 ofhidden border2 bg-whitee coolbg shadow-sm height100 prelative"> <a href="doctor/dr-gunjan-h-prasad" class="d-block p-3 pb-0 text-center rounded-3 bg-white"> <img src="images/placeholder_2.jpg" data-src="images/1705736163Dr-Gunjan-H-Prasad.jpg" data-srcset="images/1705736163Dr-Gunjan-H-Prasad.jpg" alt="Dr. Gunjan H Prasad" class="max mb-2 rounded-3 lazy" width="230" height="256"> </a> <hr class="op1 mt-0"> <div class="text-center px-3"> <h4 class="font18 fw-600 mb-1"><a href="doctor/dr-gunjan-h-prasad" class="d-block th-color">Dr. Gunjan H Prasad</a></h4> <p class="lh-22 font14 m-0 fw-500 color333">MBBS, DCP, DNB, DrNB, Hemato-Oncologist &amp; BMT</p> </div> <div class="sanko"> <div class="full px-3 pb-2 d-flex align-items-center justify-content-center"> <a href="doctor/dr-gunjan-h-prasad" class="btn btn-sm btn3 lh-20 font14 outline">Know More <i class="bi bi-arrow-right-short"></i></a> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </section> <section class="py-5 ofhidden prelative bg-theme" data-bg="images/bg-event2.png" style="background-image: url(images/bg-event2.png);"> <div class="container pjustify"> <div class="row gy-3 gy-lg-0"> <div class="col-lg-3 col-12 sidebar"> <h2 class="h4 White fw-bold text-uppercase p-2" style="color:white;">We Ensure Patient Safety and Comfort</h2> </div> <div class="col-lg-9 col-12"> <div class="row gy-2"> <div class="col-12"> <div class="border1 p-3 Safety rounded-5 height100 d-flex align-items-center justify-content-center bg-theme"> <div class="bglight p-3 rounded"> <img src="images/State-of-the-art-Technology.png" width="80px" height="80px" alt="Patient Safety and Comfort" class="opacity8"> </div> <div class="ms-3"> <h3 class="fw-600 white">State-of-the-art Technology</h3> <p class="white">We are equipped with high-quality and advanced technological infrastructure with modular operation theatres, diagnostic services, and electronic health information for transformation-driven healthcare solutions.</p> </div> </div> </div> <div class="col-12"> <div class="border1 p-3 rounded-5 Safety height100 d-flex align-items-center justify-content-center bg-theme"> <div class="bglight p-3 rounded"> <img src="images/Dedicated-Team.png" width="80px" height="80px" alt="Dedicated Team" class="opacity8"> </div> <div class="ms-3"> <h3 class="fw-600 white">Dedicated Team</h3> <p class="white">Our experienced medical professionals are committed to providing personalized and patient-centric care with a reassuring and trustworthy atmosphere.</p> </div> </div> </div> <div class="col-12"> <div class="border1 p-3 rounded-5 Safety height100 d-flex align-items-center justify-content-center bg-theme"> <div class="bglight p-3 rounded"> <img src="images/Infection-Control-Measures.png" width="80px" height="80px" alt="Infection Control Measures"> </div> <div class="ms-3"> <h3 class="fw-600 white">Infection Control Measures</h3> <p class="white">At Samridhi Hospital, we maintain a strict infection control measure to maintain a hygienic environment. This also enables you to experience a safe hospital stay with minimal risk of infections.</p> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </section> <section class="py-4 py-lg-5 prelative"> <div class="container py-2 py-lg-5"> <div class="border2 bg-white rounded-5 ofhidden"> <div class="intl row g-0"> <div class="col-12 col-lg-6"> <img src="images/international-patients.jpg" alt="International Patients" class="max"> </div> <div class="col-12 col-lg-6"> <div class="p-3 p-lg-4 p-xl-5 height100 d-flex flex-column justify-content-center"> <h3 class="h2 fw-600 th-color">For International Patients</h3> <p>Acquire personalised and healthcare solutions for all your needs, regardless of your location, at Samridhi Hospital in Siliguri.Our Department of International Patients will ensure you have a comfortable and hassle-free medical journey at Samridhi Hospital.</p> <p>To know about our international patient services you can call or email us.</p> <div class="clearfix"></div> <div> <a href="tel:+917478066817" class="btn btn3 btn-sm"><i class="bi bi-telephone me-1"></i> Call Patient's Services Desk </a> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </section> <section class="ofhidden bg3 obg" data-bg="images/bg-event.png"> <div class="container-fluid full p-0"> <div class="row g-0"> <div class="col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-2 d-none d-lg-block"></div> <div class="col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-4 py-4 py-lg-5 px-3 px-lg-0"> <h3 class="h2 fw-600 mb-3 white">Events &amp; Updates</h3> <div class="eventBox shdaow1 p-2 p-lg-3 p-xl-4 border1 rounded-start my-3 bg-white transition"> <div class="row"> <div class="col-4"> <a href="e/celebration-of-international-yoga-day-at-Samridhi-hospital"> <img src="images/placeholder-cover.jpg" data-src="images/17189524421.jpg" data-srcset="images/17189524421.jpg" alt="Celebration of International Yoga Day at Samridhi Hospital" class="max lazy objectfit rounded"> </a> </div> <div class="col-8"> <div class="desco"> <h4 class="font17 lh-24 mb-2"><a class="" href="e/celebration-of-international-yoga-day-at-Samridhi-hospital">Celebration of International Yoga Day at Samridhi Hospital</a></h4> <p class="font14 m-0 op8"><i class="bi bi-calendar2"></i> 21 June, 2024</p> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div class="eventBox shdaow1 p-2 p-lg-3 p-xl-4 border1 rounded-start my-3 bg-white transition"> <div class="row"> <div class="col-4"> <a href="e/dr-vishant-deo-has-been-awarded-with-the-icon-of-north-bengal-award-2024"> <img src="images/placeholder-cover.jpg" data-src="images/1710171971THE-ICON-OF-NORTH-BENGAL-AWARD-2024.jpg" data-srcset="images/1710171971THE-ICON-OF-NORTH-BENGAL-AWARD-2024.jpg" alt="Dr. Vishant Deo has been awarded with THE ICON OF NORTH BENGAL AWARD 2024" class="max lazy objectfit rounded"> </a> </div> <div class="col-8"> <div class="desco"> <h4 class="font17 lh-24 mb-2"><a class="" href="e/dr-vishant-deo-has-been-awarded-with-the-icon-of-north-bengal-award-2024">Dr. Vishant Deo has been awarded with THE ICON OF NORTH BENGAL AWARD 2024</a></h4> <p class="font14 m-0 op8"><i class="bi bi-calendar2"></i> 10 March 2024</p> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div class="eventBox shdaow1 p-2 p-lg-3 p-xl-4 border1 rounded-start my-3 bg-white transition"> <div class="row"> <div class="col-4"> <a href="e/Samridhi-hospital-opening-ceremony"> <img src="images/placeholder-cover.jpg" data-src="images/1708610190event-cover.jpg" data-srcset="images/1708610190event-cover.jpg" alt="Samridhi Hospital Opening Ceremony" class="max lazy objectfit rounded"> </a> </div> <div class="col-8"> <div class="desco"> <h4 class="font17 lh-24 mb-2"><a class="" href="e/Samridhi-hospital-opening-ceremony">Samridhi Hospital Opening Ceremony</a></h4> <p class="font14 m-0 op8"><i class="bi bi-calendar2"></i> 11 February, 2024</p> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div class="mt-3"> <a href="events" class="btn btn5 btn-sm">Find All Events</a> </div> </div> <div class="col-12 col-md-6"> <img src="images/placeholder-home.jpg" data-src="images/homepage.jpg" data-srcset="images/homepage.jpg" alt="Samridhi Hospital" class="max objectfit lazy"> </div> </div> </div> </section> <section class="py-5 ofhidden"> <div class="container pjustify"> <h2 class="h3 fw-600 mb-4 text-center">Why Samridhi Hospital is Siliguri's Top Choice for Exceptional Healthcare?</h2> <p class="text-center pb-3">At Samridhi Hospital in Siliguri, we prioritize compassionate care, ensuring that every patient receives respectful and empathetic treatment. Our healing environment fosters positivity, reflecting our commitment to being the premier multispecialty hospital in the region.</p> <div class="row gy-3 gy-lg-0"> <div class="col-12 col-lg-6"> <div class="border2 rounded-5 bglight item overflow-hidden"> <div class="px-3"> <h3 class="fw-600 th-color pt-3">Unmatched Expertise</h3> <p class="font16">Our experienced team of medical professionals ensure to provide you successful health outcomes. We offer round the clock services for your betterment.</p> </div> <img src="images/Unmatched-Expertise.jpg" class="max" alt="Unmatched Expertise"> </div> </div> <div class="col-12 col-lg-6"> <div class="border2 rounded-5 bglight item overflow-hidden"> <div class="px-3"> <h3 class="fw-600 th-color pt-3">Advanced Technology</h3> <p class="font16">A We always stay ahead of the medical advancements so that you get to avail of the effective and latest treatment options for a speedy recovery.</p> </div> <img src="images/Advanced-Technology.jpg" class="max" alt="Advanced Technology"> </div> </div> </div> </div> </section> <section class="py-4 py-lg-5 prelative coolbg"> <div class="container"> <div class="col-lg-12 col-xl-12"> <h3 class="text-center h2 fw-600 mb-3 mb-lg-4">Patient Testimonials</h3> <div class="testimonial navcenter owl-carousel"> <div class="testimonial-block p-2"> <div class="testimonial-content height100 p-3 pt-4 p-lg-4 p-xl-5 pb-xl-4 rounded bg-white9 ofhidden shadow1"> <div class="text-center"> <span class="fw-600 d-flex align-items-center justify-content-center">5.0 <i class="bi bi-Samridhi-fill color2 font13 ms-2"></i> <i class="bi bi-Samridhi-fill color2 font13 mx-1"></i> <i class="bi bi-Samridhi-fill color2 font13"></i> <i class="bi bi-Samridhi-fill color2 font13 mx-1"></i> <i class="bi bi-Samridhi-fill color2 font13"></i> </span> <div class="font16 mt-3"> <p>Dr Vishant Deo is a wonderful doctor and a gentleman who recently did a gallbladder stone operation on my aunty. Anyone having problems regarding gall bladder and appendix etc visit him without any hesitation.</p> </div> <div class="mb-5"> <img src="images/user.svg" data-src="images/1705572948user.svg" data-srcset="images/1705572948user.svg" alt="Tahamina Parveen" class="max rounded-circle lazy mb-2 bg-white" width="50" height="50"> <h4 class="fw-600 h6 mb-1 d-block">Tahamina Parveen, <span class="font14">Siliguri</span></h4> </div> <div class="clearfix"></div> </div> </div> </div> <div class="testimonial-block p-2"> <div class="testimonial-content height100 p-3 pt-4 p-lg-4 p-xl-5 pb-xl-4 rounded bg-white9 ofhidden shadow1"> <div class="text-center"> <span class="fw-600 d-flex align-items-center justify-content-center">5.0 <i class="bi bi-Samridhi-fill color2 font13 ms-2"></i> <i class="bi bi-Samridhi-fill color2 font13 mx-1"></i> <i class="bi bi-Samridhi-fill color2 font13"></i> <i class="bi bi-Samridhi-fill color2 font13 mx-1"></i> <i class="bi bi-Samridhi-fill color2 font13"></i> </span> <div class="font16 mt-3"> <p>One of the best hospitals in Siliguri with the top most doctors in the town. Affordable health care solutions with quality. The doctors provide personalised treatment. The medical staff provides the utmost care and comfort. I highly recommend the hospital.</p> </div> <div class="mb-5"> <img src="images/user.svg" data-src="images/1705572948user.svg" data-srcset="images/1705572948user.svg" alt="Prakash Shankar" class="max rounded-circle lazy mb-2 bg-white" width="50" height="50"> <h4 class="fw-600 h6 mb-1 d-block">Prakash Shankar, <span class="font14">Bihar</span></h4> </div> <div class="clearfix"></div> </div> </div> </div> <div class="testimonial-block p-2"> <div class="testimonial-content height100 p-3 pt-4 p-lg-4 p-xl-5 pb-xl-4 rounded bg-white9 ofhidden shadow1"> <div class="text-center"> <span class="fw-600 d-flex align-items-center justify-content-center">5.0 <i class="bi bi-Samridhi-fill color2 font13 ms-2"></i> <i class="bi bi-Samridhi-fill color2 font13 mx-1"></i> <i class="bi bi-Samridhi-fill color2 font13"></i> <i class="bi bi-Samridhi-fill color2 font13 mx-1"></i> <i class="bi bi-Samridhi-fill color2 font13"></i> </span> <div class="font16 mt-3"> <p>I highly recommend Samridhi Hospital for its cooperation and kindness towards the patients. Doctors handle with utmost care and support patients at every step. I would highly recommend Samridhi Hospital as a must-go-to to anyone seeking treatments in and around Siliguri.</p> </div> <div class="mb-5"> <img src="images/user.svg" data-src="images/1705572948user.svg" data-srcset="images/1705572948user.svg" alt="Sakshi Saroj" class="max rounded-circle lazy mb-2 bg-white" width="50" height="50"> <h4 class="fw-600 h6 mb-1 d-block">Sakshi Saroj, <span class="font14">Kalimpong</span></h4> </div> <div class="clearfix"></div> </div> </div> </div> <div class="testimonial-block p-2"> <div class="testimonial-content height100 p-3 pt-4 p-lg-4 p-xl-5 pb-xl-4 rounded bg-white9 ofhidden shadow1"> <div class="text-center"> <span class="fw-600 d-flex align-items-center justify-content-center">5.0 <i class="bi bi-Samridhi-fill color2 font13 ms-2"></i> <i class="bi bi-Samridhi-fill color2 font13 mx-1"></i> <i class="bi bi-Samridhi-fill color2 font13"></i> <i class="bi bi-Samridhi-fill color2 font13 mx-1"></i> <i class="bi bi-Samridhi-fill color2 font13"></i> </span> <div class="font16 mt-3"> <p>The services provided by Samridhi Hospital were very professional. They have a team of highly skilled doctors and medical staff that ensure to provide the best services to the patients. I appreciate the efforts made by them during my treatment.</p> </div> <div class="mb-5"> <img src="images/user.svg" data-src="images/1705572948user.svg" data-srcset="images/1705572948user.svg" alt="Priyanka Rai" class="max rounded-circle lazy mb-2 bg-white" width="50" height="50"> <h4 class="fw-600 h6 mb-1 d-block">Priyanka Rai, <span class="font14">Darjeeling</span></h4> </div> <div class="clearfix"></div> </div> </div> </div> <div class="testimonial-block p-2"> <div class="testimonial-content height100 p-3 pt-4 p-lg-4 p-xl-5 pb-xl-4 rounded bg-white9 ofhidden shadow1"> <div class="text-center"> <span class="fw-600 d-flex align-items-center justify-content-center">5.0 <i class="bi bi-Samridhi-fill color2 font13 ms-2"></i> <i class="bi bi-Samridhi-fill color2 font13 mx-1"></i> <i class="bi bi-Samridhi-fill color2 font13"></i> <i class="bi bi-Samridhi-fill color2 font13 mx-1"></i> <i class="bi bi-Samridhi-fill color2 font13"></i> </span> <div class="font16 mt-3"> <p>I would highly recommend Samridhi Hospital for acquiring treatments in Siliguri. They have a team of experienced doctors who provide world-class treatments. The medical staff were very helpful and provided us utmost care throughout our treatment.</p> </div> <div class="mb-5"> <img src="images/user.svg" data-src="images/1705572948user.svg" data-srcset="images/1705572948user.svg" alt="Amit Das" class="max rounded-circle lazy mb-2 bg-white" width="50" height="50"> <h4 class="fw-600 h6 mb-1 d-block">Amit Das, <span class="font14">Jalpaiguri</span></h4> </div> <div class="clearfix"></div> </div> </div> </div> <div class="testimonial-block p-2"> <div class="testimonial-content height100 p-3 pt-4 p-lg-4 p-xl-5 pb-xl-4 rounded bg-white9 ofhidden shadow1"> <div class="text-center"> <span class="fw-600 d-flex align-items-center justify-content-center">5.0 <i class="bi bi-Samridhi-fill color2 font13 ms-2"></i> <i class="bi bi-Samridhi-fill color2 font13 mx-1"></i> <i class="bi bi-Samridhi-fill color2 font13"></i> <i class="bi bi-Samridhi-fill color2 font13 mx-1"></i> <i class="bi bi-Samridhi-fill color2 font13"></i> </span> <div class="font16 mt-3"> <p>I went to Samridhi Hospital for my dental checkup and was fully satisfied with their service. The Hospital provides quality healthcare solutions through professional doctors and staff. The hospital is equipped with state-of-the-art facilities and has a patient-friendly environment.&nbsp;</p> </div> <div class="mb-5"> <img src="images/user.svg" data-src="images/1705572948user.svg" data-srcset="images/1705572948user.svg" alt="Samir Chettri" class="max rounded-circle lazy mb-2 bg-white" width="50" height="50"> <h4 class="fw-600 h6 mb-1 d-block">Samir Chettri, <span class="font14">Gangtok</span></h4> </div> <div class="clearfix"></div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </section> <section class="py-4 py-lg-5"> <div class="container"> <img src="images/pharmacy.jpg" alt="24x7 Pharmacy" class="max rounded-3"> </div> </section> <section class="py-4 ofhidden"> <div class="container"> <div class="border2 bg-white rounded-5 ofhidden"> <div class="intl row g-0"> <div class="col-xxl-9 col-lg-7"> <div class="p-3 p-lg-4 p-xl-5 height100 d-flex flex-column justify-content-center"> <h3 class="h3 fw-600 th-color mb-2">Visit Us Today - Your Health is Always Our Priority</h3> <p>Experience the best healthcare services at Samridhi Hospital. Visit our facility today or schedule an appointment with an experienced doctor to attain the highest standard of care, which makes us the best hospital in Siliguri.</p> <div class="clearfix"></div> </div> </div> <div class="col-xxl-3 col-lg-5"> <img src="images/visit-us.jpg" alt="Visit Us Today" class="max"> </div> </div> </div> </div> </section> <!-- <section class="py-4 ofhidden"> <div class="container text-center"> <div class="row"> <div class="col-4"> <div class="img-wrap"> <img src="images/visit-us.jpg" class="max" alt=""> </div> </div> <div class="col-8"> <h2 class="h3 fw-600 mb-4">Visit Us Today - Your Health is Always Our Priority</h2> <p>Experience the best healthcare services at Samridhi Hospital. Visit our facility today or schedule an appointment with an experienced doctor to attain the highest standard of care, which makes us the best healthcare option in Siliguri.</p> </div> </div> </div> </section> --> <section class="prelative bglight py-4 py-lg-5"> <div class="container"> <div class="row justify-content-center"> <div class="col-12 col-md-8 col-lg-10 my-3"> <h3 class="text-center h2 fw-600 mb-3 mb-lg-4">Frequently Asked Questions</h3> <div class="faq-accordion"> <div class="accordion" id="accordion"> <div class="accordion-item mb-2"> <h5 class="accordion-header bg-white"> <a data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#collapse1" aria-expanded=" true" aria-controls="collapse1" aria-label="collapse" class="accordion-button p-3 fw-500 font17 active" href="javascript:void(0)"> <i class="bi bi-question-circle-fill me-2 color3"></i> How can I make an appointment with a doctor? </a> </h5> <div id="collapse1" data-bs-parent="#accordion" class="accordion-content accordion-collapse collapse p-3 prelative show"> <span class="d-inline-block depoo color3"><i class="bi bi-arrow-right"></i> </span> <p>To schedule an appointment with us, you have two convenient options available. You can either call our appointment desk at +91 74780 66817 or you can use the online appointment booking system through our website, which is available 24/7 for your convenience.</p> </div> </div> <div class="accordion-item mb-2"> <h5 class="accordion-header bg-white"> <a data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#collapse2" aria-expanded=" " aria-controls="collapse2" aria-label="collapse" class="accordion-button p-3 fw-500 font17 collapsed" href="javascript:void(0)"> <i class="bi bi-question-circle-fill me-2 color3"></i> What insurance plans does the hospital accept? </a> </h5> <div id="collapse2" data-bs-parent="#accordion" class="accordion-content accordion-collapse collapse p-3 prelative "> <span class="d-inline-block depoo color3"><i class="bi bi-arrow-right"></i> </span> <p>Samridhi Hospital accept a diverse array of insurance plans, so rest assured that your coverage is likely to be accepted. Kindly visit our website to determine whether your insurance is among those we accept.</p> </div> </div> <div class="accordion-item mb-2"> <h5 class="accordion-header bg-white"> <a data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#collapse3" aria-expanded=" " aria-controls="collapse3" aria-label="collapse" class="accordion-button p-3 fw-500 font17 collapsed" href="javascript:void(0)"> <i class="bi bi-question-circle-fill me-2 color3"></i> How can I access my medical records? </a> </h5> <div id="collapse3" data-bs-parent="#accordion" class="accordion-content accordion-collapse collapse p-3 prelative "> <span class="d-inline-block depoo color3"><i class="bi bi-arrow-right"></i> </span> <p>You can visit our health information management department to access your medical records. To know more about the department head on to our website.</p> </div> </div> <div class="accordion-item mb-2"> <h5 class="accordion-header bg-white"> <a data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#collapse4" aria-expanded=" " aria-controls="collapse4" aria-label="collapse" class="accordion-button p-3 fw-500 font17 collapsed" href="javascript:void(0)"> <i class="bi bi-question-circle-fill me-2 color3"></i> What medical services does Samridhi Hospital offer in Siliguri? </a> </h5> <div id="collapse4" data-bs-parent="#accordion" class="accordion-content accordion-collapse collapse p-3 prelative "> <span class="d-inline-block depoo color3"><i class="bi bi-arrow-right"></i> </span> <p>Samridhi Hospital is considered the best because of its diverse medical departments. Some of the medical fields here are gastroenterology, gynecology, critical care, urology, general surgery, and cardiology.</p> </div> </div> <div class="accordion-item mb-2"> <h5 class="accordion-header bg-white"> <a data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#collapse5" aria-expanded=" " aria-controls="collapse5" aria-label="collapse" class="accordion-button p-3 fw-500 font17 collapsed" href="javascript:void(0)"> <i class="bi bi-question-circle-fill me-2 color3"></i> What sets Samridhi Hospital apart as the premier hospital in Siliguri? </a> </h5> <div id="collapse5" data-bs-parent="#accordion" class="accordion-content accordion-collapse collapse p-3 prelative "> <span class="d-inline-block depoo color3"><i class="bi bi-arrow-right"></i> </span> <p>Samridhi Hospital is renowned as the best hospital in Siliguri because of its integrated care, holistic approach, skilled medical professionals, and wide variety of specialties.</p> </div> </div> <div class="accordion-item mb-2"> <h5 class="accordion-header bg-white"> <a data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#collapse6" aria-expanded=" " aria-controls="collapse6" aria-label="collapse" class="accordion-button p-3 fw-500 font17 collapsed" href="javascript:void(0)"> <i class="bi bi-question-circle-fill me-2 color3"></i> What advanced facilities and technologies are provided by Samridhi Hospital? </a> </h5> <div id="collapse6" data-bs-parent="#accordion" class="accordion-content accordion-collapse collapse p-3 prelative "> <span class="d-inline-block depoo color3"><i class="bi bi-arrow-right"></i> </span> <p>Samridhi Hospital is equipped with modern and advanced technologies to ensure optimal care. Some of the advanced facilities in Samridhi Hospital are cutting-edge medical technologies, advanced diagnostic tools, and modern operation theatres.</p> </div> </div> <div class="accordion-item mb-2"> <h5 class="accordion-header bg-white"> <a data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#collapse7" aria-expanded=" " aria-controls="collapse7" aria-label="collapse" class="accordion-button p-3 fw-500 font17 collapsed" href="javascript:void(0)"> <i class="bi bi-question-circle-fill me-2 color3"></i> Can I avail of emergency services in Samridhi Hospital? </a> </h5> <div id="collapse7" data-bs-parent="#accordion" class="accordion-content accordion-collapse collapse p-3 prelative "> <span class="d-inline-block depoo color3"><i class="bi bi-arrow-right"></i> </span> <p>Yes, we have a top-notch emergency service department that can offer you 24/7 precise treatment. You can visit this department to avail of immediate care from a skilled medical team.</p> </div> </div> <div class="accordion-item mb-2"> <h5 class="accordion-header bg-white"> <a data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#collapse8" aria-expanded=" " aria-controls="collapse8" aria-label="collapse" class="accordion-button p-3 fw-500 font17 collapsed" href="javascript:void(0)"> <i class="bi bi-question-circle-fill me-2 color3"></i> What distinguishes Samridhi Hospital as the top choice for surgeries in Siliguri? </a> </h5> <div id="collapse8" data-bs-parent="#accordion" class="accordion-content accordion-collapse collapse p-3 prelative "> <span class="d-inline-block depoo color3"><i class="bi bi-arrow-right"></i> </span> <p>Samridhi Hospital is equipped with a team of experienced surgeons and advanced surgical infrastructure to perform various laparoscopic as well as open surgeries. You can attain precise surgical methods and successful outcomes from here.</p> </div> </div> <div class="accordion-item mb-2"> <h5 class="accordion-header bg-white"> <a data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#collapse9" aria-expanded=" " aria-controls="collapse9" aria-label="collapse" class="accordion-button p-3 fw-500 font17 collapsed" href="javascript:void(0)"> <i class="bi bi-question-circle-fill me-2 color3"></i> How advanced technologies are integrated into the healthcare landscape by Samridhi Hospital? </a> </h5> <div id="collapse9" data-bs-parent="#accordion" class="accordion-content accordion-collapse collapse p-3 prelative "> <span class="d-inline-block depoo color3"><i class="bi bi-arrow-right"></i> </span> <p>Samridhi Hospital always prioritizes medical innovation and also implements it in the healthcare landscape. From this hospital, you can avail of cutting-edge technology, modern operation theatres, state-of-the-art facilities, and advanced diagnostic tools.</p> </div> </div> <div class="accordion-item mb-2"> <h5 class="accordion-header bg-white"> <a data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#collapse10" aria-expanded=" " aria-controls="collapse10" aria-label="collapse" class="accordion-button p-3 fw-500 font17 collapsed" href="javascript:void(0)"> <i class="bi bi-question-circle-fill me-2 color3"></i> How does Samridhi Hospital contribute to Siliguri’s community health? </a> </h5> <div id="collapse10" data-bs-parent="#accordion" class="accordion-content accordion-collapse collapse p-3 prelative "> <span class="d-inline-block depoo color3"><i class="bi bi-arrow-right"></i> </span> <p>Samridhi Hospital actively engages in community health through health camps, community health programs, and awareness initiatives to provide health awareness in Siliguri.</p> </div> </div> <div class="accordion-item mb-2"> <h5 class="accordion-header bg-white"> <a data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#collapse11" aria-expanded=" " aria-controls="collapse11" aria-label="collapse" class="accordion-button p-3 fw-500 font17 collapsed" href="javascript:void(0)"> <i class="bi bi-question-circle-fill me-2 color3"></i> How does Samridhi Hospital ensure a smooth admission process? </a> </h5> <div id="collapse11" data-bs-parent="#accordion" class="accordion-content accordion-collapse collapse p-3 prelative "> <span class="d-inline-block depoo color3"><i class="bi bi-arrow-right"></i> </span> <p>You can experience a seamless admission process at Samridhi Hospital. You can visit our admission desk or explore the official website to gather detailed information about the admission procedure.</p> </div> </div> <div class="accordion-item mb-2"> <h5 class="accordion-header bg-white"> <a data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#collapse12" aria-expanded=" " aria-controls="collapse12" aria-label="collapse" class="accordion-button p-3 fw-500 font17 collapsed" href="javascript:void(0)"> <i class="bi bi-question-circle-fill me-2 color3"></i> What amenities are available for patients and visitors at Samridhi Hospital? </a> </h5> <div id="collapse12" data-bs-parent="#accordion" class="accordion-content accordion-collapse collapse p-3 prelative "> <span class="d-inline-block depoo color3"><i class="bi bi-arrow-right"></i> </span> <p>Samridhi Hospital in Siliguri offers comfortable amenities for patients and visitors, including spacious waiting areas, cafeteria services, parking facilities, and patient accommodation options. We strive to create a supportive and welcoming environment for all.</p> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </section> <section class="prelative bglight py-4 py-lg-5"> <div class="container"> <div class="row justify-content-center g-3"> <div class="col-12 col-lg-7 p-3 p-lg-4 px-4 px-lg-5 rounded-3 coolbg"> <h4 class="fw-600 mb-3">Quick Links</h4> <ul class="listas angle half-sm fw-400 m-0 p-0"> <li><a href="index.html">Home</a></li> <li><a href="about">About Us</a></li> <li><a href="departments">Departments</a></li> <li><a href="doctor">Doctors</a></li> <li><a href="faq">FAQs</a></li> <li><a href="appointment">Boo